  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "addition, adding, supplementation",
      "explanation": "The act of adding a substance to something, typically in a technical, industrial, or food science context. Most commonly refers to adding chemicals, preservatives, flavoring, or other substances to food or products."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "13353_tenka_ex1",
      "japanese": "{添加|てんか}{物|ぶつ}が{入|はい}っていない。",
      "english": "It contains no additives.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13353_tenka_ex2",
      "japanese": "{食品|しょくひん}{添加|てんか}{物|ぶつ}の{安全性|あんぜんせい}が{問題|もんだい}になっている。",
      "english": "The safety of food additives has become an issue.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13353_tenka_ex3",
      "japanese": "この{製品|せいひん}には{人工|じんこう}{着色料|ちゃくしょくりょう}や{保存料|ほぞんりょう}を{添加|てんか}していません。",
      "english": "No artificial coloring or preservatives have been added to this product.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "USAGE:\nMost commonly encountered in the compound {添加|てんか}{物|ぶつ} (additive), especially {食品|しょくひん}{添加|てんか}{物|ぶつ} (food additive). This is by far the most frequent context for this word.\n\nNot to be confused with the homophone {天下|てんか} (the world, the realm).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {添加|てんか}{物|ぶつ}: additive\n- {食品|しょくひん}{添加|てんか}{物|ぶつ}: food additive\n- {無|む}{添加|てんか}: additive-free, no additives\n- {添加|てんか}{物|ぶつ}{不使用|ふしよう}: no additives used\n- {添加|てんか}{剤|ざい}: additive agent",
